commit 9a5b0443
author: ErfanBagheri404
date: 2026-10-22 17:16:28 -0600
subject: feat: New Models discovery for all providers (incl. custom/free)

Add a "Model Discovery" section on the Providers page that surfaces newly
added models across every connected provider — OAuth, API-key, free tier,
and self-added compatible nodes. Backend diffs the live model catalog (via
the existing buildModelsList pipeline) against a new seenModels SQLite table
and flags genuinely-new models with NEW/FREE badges. First run seeds the
baseline so existing models are not reported as new.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>


